{"sourceUrl":"https://yxy.csu.edu.cn/info/1042/4076.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:28.601637+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://yxy.csu.edu.cn/info/1042/4076.htm","html":"<div><div>\n\n\n<div>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span><span>为促进各高校优秀大学生之间的交流，湘雅药学院决定举办</span><span>2025年暑期招生宣讲开放日活动（以下简称开放日活动），现就开放日活动相关事项通知如下。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>一、活动宗旨</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>开放日活动旨在搭建学院与学生交流互动平台，活动期间学员有机会了解学院研究生招生政策，聆听知名学者讲座，与相关专业教授进行交流，促进师生之间的相互了解，感受学校良好的教学科研氛围。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>二、申请条件</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（一）热爱祖国，拥护中国共产党的领导，愿为祖国建设服务；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（二）遵纪守法，品行端正，无任何考试作弊和剽窃他人学术成果记录；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（三）</span></span><span><span>经教育部批准具有推荐免试攻读硕士学位研究生资格高校的</span><span>2026</span><span>届优秀本科生</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（四）学习成绩优异，综合素质高，有志于从事科学研究工作，有较强的研究能力。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>二、申请专业</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>100700药学（学术学位）、105500药学（专业学位）</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>三、报名时间与方式</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>报名时间：</span></span><span>202</span><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>—</span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>10</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>报名方式：线上报名，登录</span><span>“中南大学</span><span>2025</span><span>年优秀大学生暑期招生宣讲开放日”网站报名，报名链接：</span><span>https://yjszsgl.csu.edu.cn/zsglxly/tmsgl/default.aspx</span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>四、活动时间与方式</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>举办时间：</span></span><span>2025<span>年</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>17</span></span><span><span>日。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>举办方式：线下举办。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>五、资格审查</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2025</span><span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>14</span><span>日前完成对报名学生的报名审查，学生可通过报名网站点击“申请状态查询”，如</span><span>状态</span><span>为</span><span>“申请信息院系审核合格”即为取得报名资格。申请状态显示为</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>申请信息院系审核合格</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>的学生于</span></span><span>7</span><span><span>月</span></span><span>1</span><span><span>5</span><span>日前将以下材料扫描为</span></span><span>1</span><span><span>个</span></span><span>PDF</span><span><span>文档，命名为</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>姓名</span></span><span>-</span><span><span>本科学校</span></span><span>-</span><span><span>本科专业</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>，发送至邮箱：</span></span><span>csuxyyxy619@163.com</span><span><span>。同时加入招生宣传开放日</span><span>qq</span></span><span><span>群：</span>819599573<span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（一）</span></span><span><span>本人身份证和学生证；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（二）</span></span><span><span>网上报名《申请表》一份；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（三）</span></span><span><span>个人自述：含个人简历、参加本次开放日活动的原因、目的和期望等；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（四）</span></span><span><span>学习成绩单及成绩排名证明（由所在学校或院系教务部门加盖公章）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（五）</span></span><span><span>大学英语四级或六级考试成绩单；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（六）</span></span><span><span>学术成果（包括公开发表论文、出版著作、获得专利、获得学术科技奖项、承担课题或者其他具有学术水平的工作成果）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（七）</span></span><span><span>获得的各类荣誉、表彰、奖励证书等；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>六、具体活动安排</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>相关活动将于</span>2025<span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>1</span></span><span><span>7</span><span>日</span></span><span><span>在中南大学杏林校区湘雅药学院线下进行，包含学院介绍、专家讲座、平台参观及师生座谈等内容。具体活动安排将另行</span></span><span><span>通过</span><span>QQ</span><span>群</span></span><span><span>通知。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>七、其他说明</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（一）</span></span><span><span>申请人应提供真实、准确的材料。凡在报名等各环节中弄虚作假者，一经查实，取消参加开放日活动资格。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（二）</span></span><span><span>活动期间，请注意保证安全问题，如人身、财产、交通安全等，必须遵守中南大学的相关规定，按照统一的安排参加各项活动。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（三）我院将为入选的学生提供开放日期间工作餐，住宿及往返交通费用自理。学生报到后要求全程参加开放日活动，擅自离开者，学院将不提供相关资助。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>八、联系方式</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系人：袁老师</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系电话：</span>0731-89665603  </span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系邮箱：</span>csuxyyxy619@163.com</span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系地址：湖南长沙岳麓区桐梓坡路</span>172<span>号中南大学杏林校区湘雅药学院</span><span>C408</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>湘雅药学院研究生招生咨询</span>QQ<span>群：</span>819599573</span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://yxy.csu.edu.cn/__local/4/A3/8C/979F0B6AFEB1DCC96E16E7B8DE1_A3ECE2F2_16697.png\"/></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span>QQ</span><span><span>群号：</span></span><span>819599573<span>，扫码可加入）</span></span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span><span>中南大学湘雅药学院</span></span></p>\n<p><span>                             <span>2025</span><span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月</span><span>3</span><span>日</span></span></p>\n</div>\n\n</div></div>","textSha256":"06598ac4d1237b7022fd4d416806572b56a27dafd5f19befec7dc82e5d1f2db8","textLength":1315,"sourceSha256":"30affe8a6b0c78a8db075bead029df9e072275bca648178f47b2320962e9d9b6","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-66f23b73982efcc6c51c","title":"2025年中南大学湘雅药学院关于举办2025年优秀大学生暑期招生宣讲开放日的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:57:28.601637+00:00"}
